-- Seed the exercise catalogue.
--
-- Reference data, so it lives in a migration rather than a script: it is
-- versioned with the schema that shapes it, it goes through review like any
-- other change, and any fresh database replays it automatically.
--
-- It CANNOT be done from the app with the anon key — `exercises` has no INSERT
-- policy, deliberately. That is RLS working, not an obstacle to route around.
--
-- Ids are generated by Postgres. The 'ex-01' strings in the old mock array were
-- only ever placeholders for the mock; real rows get real uuids.

